# rsites

This directory is an rsites-generated Zola site (DevLab theme).

- Edit content under `content/` and site config in `zola.toml` / `rsites.toml`.
- Do not edit `themes/` or `public/`.
- After content or nav changes, run `rsites check` (preview with `rsites serve`).
- Follow `AGENTS.md` and the page schema in `.cursor/rules/content.mdc`.
- If `rsites.toml` has `[project]`, read that git repo for facts and write pages here.